An individual who, or his relative or partner, is holding any security of, or interest in, the assessee. However, his relative may hold security, or interest in the assessee, of face value not exceeding Rs. 1,00,000;

(viii)

An individual who, or his relative or partner, is indebted to the assessee. However, his relative may be indebted to the assessee for an amount not exceeding Rs. 1,00,000;

(ix)

An individual who, or his relative or partner, has given a guarantee or provided any security in connection with the indebtedness of any third person to the assessee. However, his relative may give guarantee or provide any security in connection with the indebtedness of any third person to the assessee for an amount not exceeding Rs. 1,00,000;

(x)

A person who, whether directly or indirectly, has business relationship with the assessee of such nature as has been prescribed under Rule 51A (see para 49.5);

